{"id":2305301,"name":"Z-epiCRealism","description":"<p>Here we are with a epiCRealism Version for ZImageTurbo.<br /><br />Since it is a pretty awesome base model on its own, i tried to give it some of the epiCRealism feeling. <em>Try it out yourself.</em><br /><br />I'm using my loved ForgeUI Neo, so i can't say much about ComfyUI Workflows or stuff, but would like to see what you can come up with.<br /><br />Under ForgeUI i ♥️ these</p><h3 id=\"settings\"><span style=\"color:rgb(230, 73, 128)\">Settings</span></h3><p><span style=\"color:rgb(190, 75, 219)\"><strong>CFG: 1-2</strong></span> (2 sometimes give better/cleaner details but adds generation time)<br /><span style=\"color:rgb(121, 80, 242)\"><strong>Steps: 9</strong></span> (8-10 are good)<br /><span style=\"color:rgb(76, 110, 245)\"><strong>Sampler: DPM++ SDE</strong></span> (Slow but best realism)<br /><span style=\"color:rgb(34, 139, 230)\"><strong>Schedule Type: Bong Tangent</strong></span> (Pretty cool variations, Beta also works good)<br /><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 170, 191)\"><strong>Time Shift: 6</strong></span> (3-6 where 3 can sometimes give pretty nice compositions)</p><p>Keep in mind that every tiny bit in the settings (Steps, Time Shift) can produce really different outputs.</p>","allowNoCredit":false,"allowCommercialUse":["RentCivit","Rent"],"allowDerivatives":false,"allowDifferentLicense":true,"type":"Checkpoint","minor":false,"sfwOnly":false,"poi":false,"nsfw":false,"nsfwLevel":1,"availability":"Public","userId":81744,"baseModels":["ZImageTurbo"],"cosmetic":null,"supportsGeneration":false,"stats":{"downloadCount":7953,"thumbsUpCount":400,"thumbsDownCount":1,"commentCount":0,"tippedAmountCount":110},"creator":{"username":"epinikion","image":"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/75543dbb-71c1-42b2-8050-a690ff6587ad/width=96/epinikion.jpeg"},"tags":["photography","photo","z-image","man","woman","zimage","base model"],"modelVersions":[{"id":2593828,"index":0,"name":"Turbo V1 (fp8)",